<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel 221-0047 bed -->
  <Weazel_221Bed.label>鼬族221-0047床</Weazel_221Bed.label>
  <!-- EN: A large Weazel bed that sleeps up to five. Three lie along the head of the bed and two lie further down. Sleepers get a mood boost for each spouse or lover they sleep beside, and people who share a spouse don't mind sharing the bed. Colonists and slaves can be assigned to it together.\n\nIn Weazel society, where having several spouses is common, it is natural for many to sleep in one bed. Weazels, who desire strong males, treat males as trophies, so they don't mind sharing their bed with a slave. Slaves who spend many nights with the Weazels slowly grow used to this place, or come to resent it even more. -->
  <Weazel_221Bed.description>最多可供五人同睡的鼬族大型床鋪。床頭並排躺三人，下方再躺兩人。每睡在一位配偶或戀人身旁，心情就會提升一些；共有同一位配偶的人同床也不會介意。殖民者與奴隸可以一起分配到這張床。\n\n在擁有多位配偶十分常見的鼬族社會裡，許多人睡在同一張床上是很自然的事。渴望強壯雄性的鼬族把雄性當作戰利品，因此不介意與奴隸同床。與鼬族共度許多夜晚的奴隸，會漸漸習慣這裡，或是對這裡懷有更深的怨恨。</Weazel_221Bed.description>
</LanguageData>
